msgid "MODÈLE DE TRANSCRIPTION"
msgstr "TRANSCRIPTION MODEL"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:47
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Modèle de transcription"
msgstr "Transcription model"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:49
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Terminez l'enregistrement avant de changer de modèle."
msgstr "Finish the recording before changing models."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:50
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Choisissez un modèle : il se télécharge et se charge tout seul. Tout tourne "
"sur ce Mac."
msgstr ""
"Choose a model: it downloads and loads on its own. Everything runs on this "
"Mac."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:60
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Téléchargement requis"
msgstr "Download required"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:61
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Téléchargement…"
msgstr "Downloading..."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:62
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Chargement requis"
msgstr "Load required"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:63
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Chargement…"
msgstr "Loading..."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:64
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Prêt"
msgstr "Ready"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:65
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Déchargement…"
msgstr "Unloading..."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:66
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Erreur du modèle"
msgstr "Model error"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:67
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Erreur de capture audio"
msgstr "Audio capture error"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:92
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"La langue affichée est celle prise en charge par Apple Speech pour la langue "
"et la région de ce Mac. Pour la modifier, ouvrez Réglages Système > Général "
"> Langue et région, puis relancez Soufflé."
msgstr ""
"The language shown is the one Apple Speech supports for this Mac’s language "
"and region. To change it, open System Settings > General > Language & "
"Region, then reopen Soufflé."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:92
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"La transcription fonctionne sans activer Siri ou Apple Intelligence. macOS "
"gère le modèle."
msgstr ""
"Transcription works without enabling Siri or Apple Intelligence. macOS "
"manages the model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:96
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Ouvrir Langue et région"
msgstr "Open Language & Region"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:107
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Apple Speech indisponible"
msgstr "Apple Speech unavailable"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:109
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Apple Speech nécessite macOS 26 ou une version ultérieure. Vérifiez les "
"mises à jour de macOS ou choisissez un autre modèle."
msgstr ""
"Apple Speech requires macOS 26 or later. Check for macOS updates or choose "
"another model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:111
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Apple Speech n'est pas pris en charge sur ce Mac. Choisissez un autre modèle "
"de transcription."
msgstr ""
"Apple Speech is not supported on this Mac. Choose another transcription "
"model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:113
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Cette version de Soufflé n'inclut pas Apple Speech. Installez une version "
"compatible ou choisissez un autre modèle."
msgstr ""
"This version of Soufflé does not include Apple Speech. Install a compatible "
"version or choose another model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:115
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"La langue et la région actuelles de ce Mac ne sont pas prises en charge par "
"Apple Speech. Modifiez-les dans Réglages Système > Général > Langue et "
"région, puis relancez Soufflé, ou choisissez un autre modèle."
msgstr ""
"Apple Speech does not support this Mac’s current language and region. Change "
"them in System Settings > General > Language & Region, then reopen Soufflé, "
"or choose another model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:117
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Les ressources Apple Speech ne sont pas disponibles pour la langue de ce "
"Mac. Choisissez une autre langue dans Langue et région, puis relancez "
"Soufflé, ou utilisez un autre modèle."
msgstr ""
"Apple Speech resources are not available for this Mac’s language. Choose "
"another language in Language & Region, then reopen Soufflé, or use another "
"model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:119
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid ""
"Impossible de vérifier la disponibilité d'Apple Speech. Relancez Soufflé "
"pour réessayer ou choisissez un autre modèle."
msgstr ""
"Apple Speech availability could not be checked. Reopen Soufflé to try again "
"or choose another model."

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:132
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Ouvrir Mise à jour de logiciels"
msgstr "Open Software Update"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:167
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Délai avant déchargement"
msgstr "Unload delay"

#: ui/components/settings/model_section.slint:168
msgctxt "ModelSection"
msgid "Décharger le modèle de la mémoire après une période d'inactivité."
msgstr "Unload model from memory after a period of inactivity."

